OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FHot
OL,6,For very hot on Thursday with plenty of
OL,7,Fstrong sunshine. Turning a little
OL,8,Ffresher and cloudier from Friday with
OL,9,Fperhaps the chance of an odd shower on
OL,10,FSaturday.
